        "founder_body": "<p>I'm Kisho Fukai, founder of KAPOK KNOT. As the fourth generation of an apparel family, I watched the industry's mass-production, mass-waste system up close — then I found kapok, and knew it was the material I wanted to build a career around.</p><p>We make things with the consumer, the producer, and the environment all in view.</p>",
